From 425010602ec7950ba825251c58b3da62c310e3e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HandSonic <8078023+handsonic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 23:41:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] net: airoha: harden NPU mailbox and terminal teardown

Bound mailbox commands to independent coherent slots so stale or ambiguous
completions cannot be reused across recovery epochs. Poison suspect slots,
validate mailbox health during recovery, and fail closed when the provider
enters terminal teardown.

Back terminal stop with the NPU reset line, gate provider MMIO and shared IRQ
state after hard-stop, and propagate boot-register and firmware-version errors
during probe so consumers cannot attach to a half-started NPU.

Signed-off-by: HandSonic <8078023+handsonic@users.noreply.github.com>
